{"id":"3441880156","kind":"answer","title":"什么样子叫做喜欢科研，不喜欢写论文但喜欢解决问题叫吗？","author":"Jarrett Ye","original_authors":["Jarrett Ye"],"original_source_urls":[],"publisher":"Jarrett Ye","column":"学委叶哥的随笔","date":"2024-03-24","updated":"2024-03-24","votes":147,"comment_count":4,"minutes":1,"chars":585,"keywords":["间隔重复","随机最短路径","DHP模型","时间序列","SSP-MMC"],"summary":"老实说，写完四篇论文后我就不太想继续写了。 发论文太花时间，发出来后方法已经过时了（被新的自己超越）。我现在回头看以前论文实验的代码，都恨不得把自己锤一遍，什么垃圾玩意。 和审稿人拉扯很烦，之前就遇到审稿人指定要求引用 A、B、C 文献（作者都是同一个人）。 现在还有一篇和别人合作在写，只想尽到自己的责任，把这个工作做完，之后…","question_detail_html":"<p>感觉自己很享受发现问题然后去解决这个问题的过程，解决过程中不断去学习相关知识的强目的性很让人向往。但是水论文、写基金很让我折磨，觉得毫无意义，这样子算喜欢科研吗？</p>","zhihu_url":"https://www.zhihu.com/question/621367052/answer/3441880156","restoration":null,"toc":[],"html":"<p data-pid=\"0TCfRjh4\">老实说，写完四篇论文后我就不太想继续写了。</p><p data-pid=\"D5cI5V4O\">发论文太花时间，发出来后方法已经过时了（被新的自己超越）。我现在回头看以前论文实验的代码，都恨不得把自己锤一遍，什么垃圾玩意。</p><p data-pid=\"SHvEY-6I\">和审稿人拉扯很烦，之前就遇到审稿人指定要求引用 A、B、C 文献（作者都是同一个人）。</p><p data-pid=\"lKzLaElJ\">现在还有一篇和别人合作在写，只想尽到自己的责任，把这个工作做完，之后要写还是自己想写再写吧。</p><p data-pid=\"aSG2LA97\">不过我依然喜欢做研究，特别是在 GitHub 上不断记录自己的研究进展，和一些志同道合的网友讨论问题和解决方案。</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-aa47607306cd40154101247066c15eee_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-e270105ea8ec1e7d1c17bdfc3e74cebd\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-e270105ea8ec1e7d1c17bdfc3e74cebd_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"2616\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-aa47607306cd40154101247066c15eee_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-e270105ea8ec1e7d1c17bdfc3e74cebd\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-e270105ea8ec1e7d1c17bdfc3e74cebd_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"2616\"/></figure><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-7e4763010a2ab8012831e100841bd430_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-11db0501388a635da9a006d5e07cc844\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-11db0501388a635da9a006d5e07cc844_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"1846\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-7e4763010a2ab8012831e100841bd430_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-11db0501388a635da9a006d5e07cc844\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-11db0501388a635da9a006d5e07cc844_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"1846\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"nxBvf3wr\">我觉得一切都开源、透明的研究，才是对领域有贡献的研究。不论是实验数据和代码，甚至也包括探索、研讨的过程，都可能给后来者带来启发。</p><p data-pid=\"tcfxc7Kr\">如果对我的研究经历和资源感兴趣，可以读一读下面这些文章：</p><a class=\"internal\" data-image=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-08134e67de67b70a126b02829d90edcc_180x120.jpg\" data-image-height=\"1592\" data-image-width=\"2251\" href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/543325359\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Thoughts Memo：我是如何在本科期间发表顶会论文的？（内含开源代码和数据集）</a><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-image=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-337e676d732039a25471c1057c54bfa3_180x120.jpg\" data-image-height=\"1480\" data-image-width=\"2700\" data-tm-id=\"577383961\" href=\"#/post/577383961\">Thoughts Memo：KDD'22 | 墨墨背单词：基于时序模型与最优控制的记忆算法 [AI+教育]</a><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-image=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-5285ed3ff6a616b988d261d5e1ec764f_180x120.jpg\" data-image-height=\"1526\" data-image-width=\"2752\" data-tm-id=\"656714407\" href=\"#/post/656714407\">Thoughts Memo：IEEE TKDE 2023 | 墨墨背单词：通过捕捉记忆动态，优化间隔重复调度</a><a class=\"internal\" data-image=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/v2-634d4ff8b5d7e4f75dbdb943716232fc_ipico.jpg\" data-image-height=\"1000\" data-image-width=\"1118\" href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/626308184\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Thoughts Memo：[本科毕设] 基于 LSTM 和间隔重复模型的复习算法研究</a><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-image=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-82281a99dbafb1ca7b46b067b6fb6c6a_180x120.jpg\" data-image-height=\"907\" data-image-width=\"1537\" data-tm-id=\"671340049\" href=\"#/post/671340049\">Thoughts Memo：FSRS 现已成为世界上最精确的间隔重复算法*</a><a class=\"internal\" data-image=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-f0435340d3230b5ff02cc131055eff4e_180x120.jpg\" data-image-height=\"1418\" data-image-width=\"1708\" href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/686756603\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">叶峻峣：目前世界最大的人类记忆行为数据集发布</a><p></p>","rec_chain":[{"id":"577383961","title":"KDD'22 | 墨墨背单词：基于时序模型与最优控制的记忆算法 [AI+教育]","author":"Junyao Ye","votes":574,"minutes":16,"reason":"本回答Level 1 核心引用"},{"id":"656714407","title":"IEEE TKDE 2023 | 墨墨背单词：通过捕捉记忆动态，优化间隔重复调度","author":"Jingyong Su","votes":335,"minutes":23,"reason":"本回答Level 1 核心引用"},{"id":"671340049","title":"FSRS 现已成为世界上最精确的间隔重复算法*","author":"ClarityInMadness","votes":182,"minutes":7,"reason":"本回答Level 1 核心引用"}],"rec_bridge":[{"id":"649704369","title":"叶峻峣, 苏敬勇, 曹译珑. 优化间隔重复调度的一种随机最短路径算法[C]//第 28 届 ACM SIGKDD 知识发现与数据挖掘学术会议论文集, 2022: 4381-4390","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":18,"minutes":2,"reason":"延伸深读 · Andy Matuschak"},{"id":"1907786810685395276","title":"FSRS for Anki 发展史","author":"Jarrett Ye","votes":341,"minutes":32,"reason":"延伸深读 · Jarrett Ye"},{"id":"649655080","title":"解释 FSRS（上篇）：算法描述与运作原理","author":"ClarityInMadness","votes":110,"minutes":6,"reason":"延伸深读 · ClarityInMadness"},{"id":"649701172","title":"解释 FSRS（下篇）：准确度","author":"ClarityInMadness","votes":62,"minutes":8,"reason":"延伸深读 · ClarityInMadness"},{"id":"692314506","title":"FSRS 是全世界最精确的间隔重复算法之一（最新基准测试更新）","author":"ClarityInMadness","votes":135,"minutes":12,"reason":"延伸深读 · ClarityInMadness"}],"rec_answers":[{"id":"3517882952","title":"如何评价近年来越来越多的本科生参与撰写人工智能领域的学术论文这一现象？","